message: "If you use this code or these derived results, please cite the repository (and the manuscript once published)."
title: "Device-calibrated burden of low physical activity"
abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline and derived results for a three-module recomputation of the GBD 2023
  attributable burden of low physical activity using device-measured (accelerometer) exposure
  instead of self-reported exposure.
type: software
